{"sections":[{"slug":"超几何函数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"超几何函数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">超几何函数</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"超几何函数"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $(a)_n := a (a+1) \\cdots (a+n-1)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为上阶乘</span>. <strong><span lang=\"zh\">超几何函数</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是如下形式幂级数的和</span>:\n$$\r\n{_p}F{_q}\\Big(\r\n    {{a_1,\\cdots,a_p}\\atop {b_1,\\cdots,b_q}};z\r\n\\Big):=\r\n\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\r\n\\frac{\r\n    (a_1)_n\\cdots (a_p)_n\r\n}{\r\n    (b_1)_n\\cdots (b_q)_n\r\n}\\frac{z^n}{n!}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}}}]}